load @term/seed/code/group/orthogonal
  find orthogonal-group

# The special orthogonal group: the rotations, the orthogonal maps of determinant one, the orientation-preserving
# length-preserving symmetries. SO(3) is the rotations of ordinary space, double-covered by the unit quaternions, and
# SO(8) is the rotation group of the arena whose algebra is D4. The form carries the orthogonal group; determinant one
# is the added condition.
form special-orthogonal-group
  link group, like orthogonal-group
